# Reference captures live outside the repo; docs/ holds only our own screenshots.

# Internal working documents — the plan and the session handoff stay local. Globbed rather
# than named: an archived HANDOFF-2026-08-25.md is the same document with a date on it, and
# the one that gets committed by accident is always the copy somebody made before a rewrite.
docs/PLAN*.md
docs/HANDOFF*.md

# The audits are internal working documents too: one lists what is missing or broken, the
# other what a user would ask for next. Both are written against the reference and neither
# is ours to publish.
docs/MISSING-BROKEN*.md
docs/USER-REQUESTS*.md

# Downloaded format specifications — reference material, not ours to redistribute.
specs/
packaging/out/
